{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261119/photo/bkn-20261119171902288-1119_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261119202018\"/><p>事主昏迷送院救治。（陳嘉順攝）</p><p>西貢發生單車意外。今午(19日)4時39分，3名男子結伴到西貢踩單車郊遊，當他們由榕樹澳抵達深涌碼頭時，其中一名姓戴(71歲)男子懷疑突然暈倒，他隨單車翻側倒地，左眼角受傷，同行車友致電報案。救援人員接報趕往現場，政府飛行服務隊也派出直升機協助，並將事主吊起送往東區醫院搶救。據悉，事主有身體病紀錄，其暈倒原因有待了解。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T12:37:10.350476+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":184,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T09:19:02+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T13:31:15.534088+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T12:30:32.502882+00:00","content_hash":"7ebfbb25691d78a6a0e42339274f6619664b7b78aeea4f7aca780457ac35bf3a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-19T12:37:10.350476+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}